{
 "_about": "Semantic slot vocabulary for custom emoji icon systems. Each slot is a MEANING. `unicode` lists acceptable Unicode equivalents in order of preference: the first one is the default fallback when no sticker resolves; when a sticker resolves, its own `emoji` field becomes the fallback (official recommendation). `label` is the text-only fallback (empty = the accent is simply dropped). `use` says where the slot belongs: button, title, inline (inside running text), status (reserved state marks), post_accent (channel posts / long texts). Matching ignores U+FE0F, so '⚙' and '⚙️' are the same key. Heuristic content of this skill, checked 2026-11-15.",
 "version": 1,
 "checked": "2026-11-15",
